Subject: Extension of lavaan code for RI-CLPM (Mund & Nestler, 2017)
Message-ID: <Mm0DkJqRFqg.F8t4T01FAgAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/lavaan/c/Mm0DkJqRFqg/m/F8t4T01FAgAJ>
