I am running a pathway analysis in Lavaan and am trying to compute post-hoc power using G*Power 3. Here is the model I have run and part of the output:

model2 <- '
# regressions
AASP_SAvo ~ SRS_T + BPQ_T
AASP_SSens ~ SRS_T + BPQ_T
